VERS 140228 258 40400
MODE SEQ
NOTE 0 Paraboloidal mirror, focal length 200 (radius -400, conic -1), EPD 50 (f/4), stop on the mirror.
NOTE 0 Object at infinity; the image sits 200 mm back along -z,
NOTE 0 so the thickness after the mirror is negative, as a folded system's always is.
NOTE 0 On axis the transmitted cone is exact: pi sin^2 a to the rim, at its own sag.
NOTE 0 The obscured version of this mirror is built in code in ExactTests.
TITL Paraboloidal mirror
UNIT MM X W X CM MR CPMM
ENPD 50
FTYP 0 0 2 1 0 0 0 0 0
XFLN 0 0 0
YFLN 0 0.5
FWGN 1 1
WAVM 1 0.55 1
PWAV 1
SURF 0
  TYPE STANDARD
  CURV 0
  DISZ INFINITY
SURF 1
  STOP
  TYPE STANDARD
  CURV -0.0025
  CONI -1
  DISZ -200
  GLAS MIRROR 0 0 0 0 0
  DIAM 25 1 0 0 1 ""
SURF 2
  TYPE STANDARD
  CURV 0
  DISZ 0
